江の娘で、淳とは6歳違いの姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"君ヶ浜神社の巫女で、母と二人で神社を支えるしっかり者の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"久しぶりの再開で男へ変わった逞しい淳の姿に、ソワソワしっぱなし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女は処女でなければと言われているので、それっぽく振舞っているものの、実は非処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高校生の頃から彼氏を神社へ連れ込んでセックスしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それがクセになって屋外でするのが好きになってしまった。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"134708"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"24 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12911","sourceWorkId":"13592","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12911","sourceWorkId":"13592","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12911","sourceWorkId":"13592","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12911","sourceWorkId":"13592","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55f7b34b57f7e444ddbce5a167527f53fde07a59fe767132b58cf3d7bcde77c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ae6f72611117e8f3b22aa45d77031acba168795f65b22c41f193d82f91d4dd5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤祐記","creatorId":"vndb:s1412","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1412","name":"近藤 祐記","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224412:134708:5904:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c22177","characterName":"外川 由紀子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"134709","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224412"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12912"],"vndbCharacterId":"c22177"},"originalCharacterName":"外川 由紀子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"34"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kimie's younger sister and Jun's aunt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She never married and has been a priestess since she was old enough to be a priestess. She is a pure and innocent woman who is a little bit out of the world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has never had a man in her life, and she is faithful to the rule that a miko must be a virgin. She has been distrustful of men ever since she had a problem with a past boyfriend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a quiet and reserved personality, but she is possessed, When she is possessed, she has a dual personality and is a very bold and determined older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22177"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"キミ江の妹で、主人公の叔母。34歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大人しく、引っ込み思案な性格。やや世間知らず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この年になっても、本来の巫女のあるべき未婚、処女を貫いてきた純真無垢な女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に交際相手とトラブルがあって以来、男性不信になってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実は憑依体質で、憑依されると、途端に姐御肌に豹変する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12912","sourceWorkId":"13592","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢：34歳　スリーサイズ：B92/ W59/ H90"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キミ江の妹で淳の叔母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚もせず年頃の頃からずっと巫女を続けてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"純真無垢でちょっと世間離れした女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫女は処女でなくてはならないという決まりに忠実で未だ男性経験なし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に交際していた相手とトラブルがあって以来、男性不信に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしめで引っ込み思案な性格だが、憑依体質で、降りてきている時は二重人格的に思い切りがいい姉御肌に。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacte