ft before he became aware of his sexuality, He is anxious about whether he can live without making mistakes. However, he discovers his mother's lewd secret..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a virgin, of course, due to his strict dormitory and his training in another family's shrine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22174"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1b18a9f85e6dd83a6f7c8dd646f97be137a9c46b67286c46c6f643b2a0e31b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b7a355a1de073ccc7091e30fbd969156e6dd924872fe360e8c67161e0658848.webp","width":176,"height":157,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1060","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2398","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1060","name":"桃フェロ","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:13592:2398","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1060","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1060","name":"桃フェロ","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42111:v3229","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p4064","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p4064","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p4064","name":"D-PLAY","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:42112:v3229","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1060","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1060","name":"桃フェロ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:7503:v3229","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1060","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1060","name":"桃フェロ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:7504:v3229","source":"vndb